 width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Evo Morales</span><span class="tp">b. 1959</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 26 October <span class="n">8</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/cedd"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/cedd.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Cedd</span><span class="tp">c. 620–664</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/alfred-the-great"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/alfred-the-great.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Alfred the Great</span><span class="tp">849–899</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/john-graves-simcoe"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/john-graves-simcoe.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">John Graves Simcoe</span><span class="tp">1752–1806</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ito-hirobumi"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ito-hirobumi.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Itō Hirobumi</span><span class="tp">1841–1909</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/aurel-stein"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/aurel-stein.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Aurel Stein</span><span class="tp">1862–1943</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ioannis-rallis"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ioannis-rallis.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Ioannis Rallis</span><span class="tp">1878–1946</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/nikos-kazantzakis"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/nikos-kazantzakis.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Nikos Kazantzakis</span><span class="tp">1883–1957</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/jacques-massu"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/jacques-massu.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Jacques Massu</span><span class="tp">1908–2002</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
